menu "Wi-Fi provisioning (wifi_manager)"

config WIFI_MANAGER_FALLBACK_DNS_IPV4
    string "Station fallback DNS server"
    default "223.5.5.5"
    help
        Installed into the station's FALLBACK DNS slot after DHCP completes,
        and only when that slot is empty. DHCP-provided main and backup DNS
        servers are never replaced. Board projects may override this value in
        their sdkconfig.defaults. Leave empty to disable the fallback.

endmenu
